WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.794 --> 00:00:13.216
Jason walked into the gym, feeling upset.

2
00:00:14.297 --> 00:00:16.578
He'd heard his dad talking on the phone last night.

3
00:00:17.119 --> 00:00:19.620
It sounded like Dad's job was about to change again.

4
00:00:19.641 --> 00:00:23.984
"What if I can't come to Kids Central anymore?"

5
00:00:24.384 --> 00:00:25.124
Jason thought.

6
00:00:29.007 --> 00:00:33.145
today's activity, you'll be in two groups," Miss Shelly said.

7
00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:37.246
"Each group will make a box for a beanbag toss."

8
00:00:38.626 --> 00:00:40.087
"Ooh," Izzie said.

9
00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:43.347
"Fun!" "How do you play?"

10
00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:44.428
Nina asked.

11
00:00:44.448 --> 00:00:48.109
"You throw beanbags into a hole," Bobby said.

12
00:00:48.129 --> 00:00:50.849
"The team with the most points wins."

13
00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:52.450
He grinned.

14
00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:54.710
"I'm awesome at this game!"

15
00:00:54.731 --> 00:00:57.411
"We can design the boxes?"

16
00:00:57.751 --> 00:00:58.552
Jason asked.

17
00:00:59.132 --> 00:01:00.092
That sounded fun.

18
00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.560
He loved to draw.

19
00:01:02.741 --> 00:01:03.661
Miss Shelly nodded.

20
00:01:03.681 --> 00:01:07.763
"We're going to make a Kids Central version of the game."

21
00:01:07.783 --> 00:01:10.765
"Cool," Ethan said.

22
00:01:12.065 --> 00:01:16.087
Jason looked at the art supplies: markers, paint, fabric, glue.

23
00:01:16.107 --> 00:01:21.769
"Team One is Bobby, Jason, and Nina," Miss Shelly said.

24
00:01:21.789 --> 00:01:27.112
"Team Two is Izzie and Ethan.

25
00:01:28.472 --> 00:01:31.113
Talk about your favorite parts of Kids Central.

26
00:01:32.374 --> 00:01:34.815
Use these ideas to decorate your box."

27
00:01:37.036 --> 00:01:38.116
Jason got a box.

28
00:01:40.037 --> 00:01:41.157
Nina taped it shut.

29
00:01:43.619 --> 00:01:46.360
Then Miss Shelly flipped it over and cut a hole in the middle.

30
00:01:51.302 --> 00:01:53.443
we have to decorate it," Bobby said.

31
00:01:53.463 --> 00:01:56.184
"What's your favorite part of Kids Central?"

32
00:01:57.324 --> 00:01:58.265
"My friends!"

33
00:01:58.625 --> 00:01:59.265
Nina said.

34
00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:01.247
"What about you, Bobby?"

35
00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:05.229
"I like playing games," Bobby said.

36
00:02:05.249 --> 00:02:06.590
"And cooking."

37
00:02:07.551 --> 00:02:09.132
Bobby and Nina looked at Jason.

38
00:02:09.152 --> 00:02:13.455
"I might have to leave Kids Central again," he blurted out.

39
00:02:13.475 --> 00:02:16.617
"What?" Nina gasped.

40
00:02:17.838 --> 00:02:20.760
Jason explained about hearing his dad's phone conversation.

41
00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:24.582
"Just talk to your dad," Bobby said.

42
00:02:24.602 --> 00:02:26.664
"Find out what's going on."

43
00:02:27.432 --> 00:02:29.093
"Yeah," Nina added.

44
00:02:29.113 --> 00:02:32.333
"Maybe you're wrong and nothing is changing."

45
00:02:33.334 --> 00:02:35.654
Jason was quiet as he reached for some markers.

46
00:02:39.495 --> 00:02:41.216
He drew three squares on the box.

47
00:02:46.277 --> 00:02:48.018
In one, he drew a flip book.

48
00:02:51.018 --> 00:02:52.919
In another, he drew a chef's hat.

49
00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.881
In the last one, he drew a movie camera.

50
00:03:04.807 --> 00:03:06.948
Nina drew a heart with everyone's face in it.

51
00:03:08.029 --> 00:03:12.233
Bobby decorated the box with balls, smoothie cups, and chicken skewers.

52
00:03:13.894 --> 00:03:15.615
Nina looked at Group Two's box.

53
00:03:15.635 --> 00:03:18.358
"Nice yoga poses, Izzie!"

54
00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:23.261
Ethan had drawn everyone playing in the snow.

55
00:03:23.281 --> 00:03:26.164
"Good work, everyone.

56
00:03:26.708 --> 00:03:28.709
Are we ready to toss beanbags?"

57
00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:30.110
Miss Shelly asked.

58
00:03:32.132 --> 00:03:35.094
Miss Shelly placed the boxes on the floor, facing each other.

59
00:03:36.234 --> 00:03:38.476
Each team stood behind the other team's box.

60
00:03:39.897 --> 00:03:43.799
"Each player tosses four beanbags," Miss Shelly explained.

61
00:03:43.819 --> 00:03:45.841
"Group One, you're up.

62
00:03:46.261 --> 00:03:47.002
Who's first?"

63
00:03:48.242 --> 00:03:49.703
Bobby tossed four bags.

64
00:03:51.665 --> 00:03:52.805
They all went into the hole.

65
00:03:55.027 --> 00:03:56.328
Jason high-fived him.

66
00:03:58.300 --> 00:03:59.881
Ethan went next for Group Two.

67
00:04:01.421 --> 00:04:02.462
He got three points.

68
00:04:05.383 --> 00:04:06.704
Then Izzie and Nina went.

69
00:04:10.345 --> 00:04:12.086
The score was tied 5-5.

70
00:04:12.106 --> 00:04:15.367
"Jason, you're up!"

71
00:04:15.547 --> 00:04:16.227
Bobby said.

72
00:04:17.588 --> 00:04:21.670
Jason tossed one, two, three beanbags.

73
00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:23.911
Only one went in.

74
00:04:23.931 --> 00:04:26.291
"One point!"

75
00:04:26.492 --> 00:04:27.252
Bobby called.

76
00:04:28.036 --> 00:04:31.319
"Yay!" Nina clapped.

77
00:04:31.339 --> 00:04:33.761
"Thanks," Jason said.

78
00:04:33.781 --> 00:04:36.303
"You guys are great teammates."

79
00:04:38.144 --> 00:04:42.308
"Miss Shelly, we want you to take our next turn," Izzie said.

80
00:04:42.328 --> 00:04:51.535
"Okay." Miss Shelly tossed all four beanbags into the hole.

81
00:04:51.555 --> 00:04:54.958
"We win!"

82
00:04:55.458 --> 00:04:56.139
Ethan said.

83
00:04:59.808 --> 00:05:02.811
Jason laughed as Ethan and Izzie did a victory dance.

84
00:05:02.831 --> 00:05:06.736
"My Kids Central friends are the best," he thought.

85
00:05:08.818 --> 00:05:09.999
And they were smart too.

86
00:05:10.019 --> 00:05:13.503
"I'll talk to Dad tonight," he decided.
